message: >-
  If you use Q-Trust in your work, please cite it using this metadata.
title: Q-Trust — post-quantum cryptography migration & attestation protocol
authors:
  - alias: humoge7502
    name-suffix: Krishna Puri
note: >-
  CBOM scanning (CycloneDX), NIST/CNSA 2.0 scoring, GNN-ranked migration
  planning, and tamper-proof attestations sealed on Base L2. The scanner
  dogfoods its own repository in CI (pqc-scan.yml).
repository-code: https://github.com/humoge7502/q-trust
url: https://humoge7502.github.io/q-trust/showcase/
abstract: >-
  An open protocol and toolchain for migrating cryptographic estates to
  post-quantum algorithms: discovery (CBOM), risk scoring, GNN-based
  migration planning, and on-chain attestation of migrated artifacts.
keywords:
